\frac{1}{-a} &= \frac{1}{-a+1} \Rightarrow a = -a+1, \\
\frac{1}{-c} &= \frac{1}{-c+1} \Rightarrow c = -c+1, \\
\frac{1}{c} &= \frac{1}{c+1} \Rightarrow c = c+1
\end{align*}

Solving these equations, we get:

\begin{align*}
